# Code owners for security-sensitive paths.
#
# GitHub honors this file when "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled
# on the main branch. Anything matched here needs an approving review from
# at least one listed owner before merge.
#
# The .github directory holds CI/CD configuration. Changes there can shift
# what runs with privileged tokens (e.g. the FD CI App token used by
# release.yml). Gating it on owner review prevents a workflow edit from
# being merged without a sanity check from someone empowered to police it.

